1
00:01:17,319 --> 00:01:17,840
Jiaojiao,

2
00:01:21,359 --> 00:01:22,319
Fu Xiang and his son

3
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,319
are dead.

4
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:26,840
Uncle,

5
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,319
how did they die?

6
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,159
It's said

7
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,200
they hanged themselves at home.

8
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:33,840
Probably they did

9
00:01:34,159 --> 00:01:35,200
too many bad things

10
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,719
and were afraid of having too many enemies,

11
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:37,760
so they ended their lives first.

12
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:39,799
The Fu family

13
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,560
is like

14
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:42,879
a deep abyss.

15
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,599
One wrong step

16
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,280
and it's over.

17
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,719
Who is Cheng Qi?

18
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:51,760
Please come with us.

19
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:05,799
Sir,

20
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,639
Cheng Qi has already completed the ceremony.

21
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:12,240
The Ministry of Rites has witnessed it.

22
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:14,800
The speech contest can now begin.

23
00:02:15,159 --> 00:02:16,240
That's good.

24
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:17,719
Cheng Qi,

25
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,280
I heard that in the final test of the Star Conference,

26
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,919
your speech is related to Langyue.

27
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:25,280
Have you been there before?

28
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,080
Your Majesty,

29
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,560
I have never been to Langyue.

30
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,639
My wife is a bodyguard.

31
00:02:32,159 --> 00:02:34,759
Her mother went to Langyue to escort goods when she was alive.

32
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,000
In recent days,

33
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,159
my wife and I have also escorted goods to Klara City.

34
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,560
and saw a little of it.

35
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,199
If so,

36
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:43,280
if the Yun State and the Langyue State trade,

37
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,560
your wife's escort agency

38
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,120
will be

39
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,319
prosperous.

40
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,360
If we get the support of the royal family,

41
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,199
it should be so.

42
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:52,960
But the business that is prosperous

43
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,639
is the business of many merchants of the two countries.

44
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:56,759
Then the speech contest

45
00:02:57,199 --> 00:02:58,400
be based on this theme.

46
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,240
What do you think?

47
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,159
Your Majesty is wise.

48
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,639
When Princess Langyue came this time,

49
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:10,080
there were many merchants from Langyue.

50
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:13,000
If this is the theme of the speech,

51
00:03:13,319 --> 00:03:15,879
it will definitely give them more confidence in trade.

52
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,560
Grand Preceptor,

53
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,080
what do you think?

54
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:32,759
What's wrong with you?

55
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:34,719
You've been gloomy since you came back.

56
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,360
The topic set by the emperor

57
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,520
shouldn't be difficult for you.

58
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:43,120
That's not what I'm worried about.

59
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,039
I think

60
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:47,319
the court is stable,

61
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:48,759
and the country is prosperous.

62
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,400
It's a great opportunity

63
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:52,280
to trade with Langyue.

64
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:53,840
It's also what the people want.

65
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,199
Choosing this topic

66
00:03:55,439 --> 00:03:56,680
and hosting a speech meeting

67
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:58,599
to invite the Langyue Mission

68
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,520
is just perfect.

69
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,280
However...

70
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:06,159
Go ahead.

71
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,039
This matter of customs clearance

72
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:10,280
is ultimately about the livelihood of the people.

73
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:12,400
The speech contest should reflect

74
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,159
the determination to share joy with the people.

75
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,560
So I suggest

76
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:18,040
holding it at the palace.

77
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,920
That's not a good idea.

78
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:22,759
Your Majesty,

79
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,199
this concerns your safety

80
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:26,759
and that of Princess Langyue.

81
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:29,279
The palace guards are more reliable.

82
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,519
What if someone breaks in?

83
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:32,680
The people of the capital live in peace

84
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:34,879
and prosperity, and you are beloved.

85
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,399
Who would dare to break in?

86
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:36,639
You...

87
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:37,800
Your Majesty,

88
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:40,839
Cheng Qi won the stargazing contest.

89
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:42,439
And the one in charge of the oratorical contest

90
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:44,480
is the Su's Escort Agency.

91
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:45,800
I suggest

92
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:49,319
the Su's Escort Agency to cooperate with the Ministry of Rites.

93
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:51,920
I will arrange the guards.

94
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:55,399
This will ensure the safety of the people of the two countries,

95
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,920
and show the kindness of the emperor,

96
00:04:58,079 --> 00:05:00,079
and the style of Yun State.

97
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:05,560
Cheng Qi,

98
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,480
what do you think?

99
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:09,279
I dare not comment.

100
00:05:09,839 --> 00:05:11,240
It's up to you.

101
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:13,680
Then let's not discuss it further.

102
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:15,279
As the Grand Preceptor said,

103
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,160
let's make this recitation meeting

104
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,600
a celebration for the people.

105
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:21,519
Cheng Qi will be in charge of the recitation,

106
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:24,959
Su's Escort Agency assists the Ministry of Rites.

107
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:27,279
The Grand Preceptor will coordinate everything.

108
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:30,319
Make sure the recitation meeting

109
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:31,720
is held as scheduled.

110
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:32,759
Yes.

111
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:35,079
Yes.

112
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:38,839
I'll take care of it.

113
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,399
It's all my fault.

114
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:43,480
I couldn't think of a perfect plan

115
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,399
when things were tense,

116
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:46,600
which led you

117
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,439
and everyone else

118
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,800
into such danger.

119
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:51,360
This was a great opportunity.

120
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,439
The royals picked you for the speech.

121
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:56,079
If the agency holds the poetry competition,

122
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,839
you'll be the royal poet,

123
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:00,759
and the agency will be the royal agency.

124
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,800
We're not thinking of the same thing.

125
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:07,079
I don't want to enter the court,

126
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:08,480
not just because of my father.

127
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:13,519
Father,

128
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:20,680
didn't you say you'd make a move at the poetry competition?

129
00:06:21,279 --> 00:06:23,639
Why let Su's Agency hold it?

130
00:06:23,879 --> 00:06:25,560
How do we get in?

131
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:26,920
And,

132
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:28,319
the Ministry of War's forces

133
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,560
are all outside of the capital.

134
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:31,279
It's hard to mobilize them

135
00:06:31,519 --> 00:06:32,759
in time.

136
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:35,319
From what I've read,

137
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,920
when it comes to court affairs,

138
00:06:38,639 --> 00:06:39,759
one wrong move

139
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,480
can be disastrous.

140
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:43,240
Don't be so anxious.

141
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:45,759
If we don't do this,

142
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,800
how can we avoid suspicion?

143
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,199
If the heavens thwart our wishes,

144
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:53,120
we must defy the heavens.

145
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,759
We should consider carefully

146
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,920
which of our blades

147
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,879
is now faster than the Ministry of War.

148
00:06:59,519 --> 00:07:01,040
The death of Fu Xiang and his son

149
00:07:01,319 --> 00:07:02,680
is definitely not that simple.

150
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:06,000
And I now suspect that the matter concerning Langyue

151
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:08,120
is greatly related to the Grand Preceptor.

152
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,360
You mean...

153
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,480
Yikeba?

154
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,319
He wants to stir up the mess

155
00:07:15,519 --> 00:07:17,279
in the Yun State more than we do.

156
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,720
Otherwise, he'll never have a chance to rise.

157
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,560
As for the speech meeting,

158
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,639
I've arranged for your sister

159
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:25,199
to go with the Su's Escort Agency.

160
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,360
He recommended you to organize

161
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,680
the speech meeting today.

162
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,680
So I'm worried

163
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:35,319
he wants to use you and me as his pawns.

164
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:39,040
He's our target.

165
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,360
As for Zhang Xi Yun,

166
00:07:42,079 --> 00:07:43,240
she's been hiding in the courtyard all day.

167
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,600
I think she's just pretending to be sick,

168
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:47,959
trying to protect herself.

169
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,079
It's not that easy.

170
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:50,839
By the way,

171
00:07:51,079 --> 00:07:52,279
how's it going with the Ministry of Rites?

172
00:07:53,439 --> 00:07:55,360
Ling Feng is under my control.

173
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,879
His father listens to us.

174
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:00,040
Then hurry up and find a way

175
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,680
to make Yikeba

176
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:04,360
our sword.

177
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,519
Okay.

178
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:15,519
My husband, you are wrong.

179
00:08:15,839 --> 00:08:16,759
The escort's life

180
00:08:16,759 --> 00:08:18,560
is a life of danger.

181
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,160
Yiguana is the princess.

182
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,560
I also do business with her.

183
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,040
My mother said

184
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:24,319
the escort must be with the goods.

185
00:08:24,519 --> 00:08:25,240
We have a clear conscience.

186
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,560
As long as we are upright

187
00:08:27,639 --> 00:08:28,839
and don't betray the Yun State,

188
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,800
who can treat us as pawns?

189
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,080
I just want you to be safe.

190
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,039
I don't want you to be in danger, you know?

191
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,799
This is our chance to achieve our ambitions together.

192
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,000
Don't you

193
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,879
want to try with me?

194
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,399
Since you said that,

195
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:02,759
let's try.

196
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:04,960
And

197
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:07,360
we're going to be the chess players.

198
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,000
By the way, my dear,

199
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,159
Zhang Xi Yun will work with you

200
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,840
to organize this event.

201
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,519
Why is she everywhere?

202
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:22,360
Did you ask her to come?

203
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,480
It's all arranged by the Grand Preceptor.

204
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:27,759
Why?

205
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:30,799
He could have just let Zhang Xi Yun do it.

206
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:33,320
So I said this matter is not that simple.

207
00:09:34,519 --> 00:09:35,240
I guess

208
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,759
they will make a move at the speech meeting.

209
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:41,840
We'll see what they do.

210
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,679
Thanks to the official's love,

211
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,360
with the style of the Yun State,

212
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,120
I hereby announce

213
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,399
the Moonlight Speech Meeting

214
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:56,720
is officially launched today.

215
00:10:04,159 --> 00:10:06,440
The Su's Escort Agency has been escorting for generations,

216
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,639
and we have encountered countless disasters.

217
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,799
We've all survived.

218
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:11,600
Now,

219
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:13,840
the best opportunity is right in front of us.

220
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,440
If we succeed in this trade,

221
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,600
we will no longer worry

222
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,919
about the business of the Escort Agency.

223
00:10:19,679 --> 00:10:20,679
From now on,

224
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:22,480
all the people in the Agency

225
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,840
will be devoted to the meeting.

226
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:26,879
Everyone must write down what they have to do

227
00:10:27,159 --> 00:10:28,120
and post it on the head of the bed.

228
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:29,279
Make progress every day

229
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,360
and report at any time.

230
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,440
Brother,

231
00:10:32,919 --> 00:10:35,360
you are in charge of props and scenery.

232
00:10:35,639 --> 00:10:36,240
No problem.

233
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:38,320
Gong Xi, Fa Cai.

234
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:40,480
You are in charge of all musicians

235
00:10:40,519 --> 00:10:41,799
and dancers.

236
00:10:41,879 --> 00:10:43,519
Make sure to supervise the rehearsal.

237
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:44,960
Yes, boss.

238
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,559
Mr. Meng,

239
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,279
I'm very relieved

240
00:10:48,279 --> 00:10:49,120
to handle the performance.

241
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:50,840
This time, I have a surprise for you.

242
00:10:50,919 --> 00:10:52,240
I'll definitely show the Langyue Mission

243
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,720
the elegance of the Yun State.

244
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:56,039
The top musician in Yunjing,

245
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,440
do you know what to do?

246
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:58,799
I can't wait.

247
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:00,879
Uncle,

248
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:03,840
you take the escort team to guard the outside.

249
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:06,559
That means

250
00:11:06,799 --> 00:11:08,279
I can't attend the speech contest, right?

251
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:10,360
You are the most important person in the Escort Agency.

252
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:13,159
The most important part can only be entrusted to you.

253
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:15,120
Although it's flattery,

254
00:11:15,679 --> 00:11:17,320
it feels much better.

255
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,960
The official has already written the theme for the speech meeting.

256
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,519
We must remember it.

257
00:11:32,159 --> 00:11:33,200
There is no distance between mountains and waters.

258
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,320
Clouds and the moon are of one family.

259
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,120
Wait.

260
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,039
Zhang Gongzi.

261
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,440
General, please don't blame me.

262
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,480
The Princess hasn't arrived in Yunjing,

263
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,559
but they're already posting a reward for you.

264
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:20,440
Let's just bear with it for now.

265
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,960
Once they arrive in Yunjing,

266
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,080
I'll kill that girl.

267
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:28,360
He and Bai Yanliang are both Moonlight Envoys.

268
00:12:28,759 --> 00:12:30,080
They have heavy guards.

269
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:31,840
Don't even think about killing her.

270
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,679
It's hard to get close to her now.

271
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:36,559
And if you kill her now,

272
00:12:36,759 --> 00:12:38,799
you'll never return to the Moonlight Sect.

273
00:12:39,879 --> 00:12:41,080
You'll die if you go back.

274
00:12:42,519 --> 00:12:43,440
So?

275
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:46,320
What's the point of killing her and Bai Yanli?

276
00:12:47,279 --> 00:12:49,320
You can't stay in the Yunjing.

277
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:50,960
Unless...

278
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,639
The king of Langyue is changed.

279
00:12:55,559 --> 00:12:56,480
You're

280
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,559
so ambitious.

281
00:13:00,159 --> 00:13:02,080
I can't kill the king of Langyue.

282
00:13:02,519 --> 00:13:05,720
What if the Yun State sends troops to attack Langyue?

283
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,720
Your royal family

284
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:11,399
advocates trade.

285
00:13:11,639 --> 00:13:13,159
They won't attack Langyue

286
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,399
at this time.

287
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,799
If the royal family was killed

288
00:13:18,399 --> 00:13:20,159
at the speech meeting,

289
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:23,240
do you think the Yun State would send troops?

290
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,960
Killing the royal family in the Yun State?

291
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:29,440
You want me to die.

292
00:13:29,879 --> 00:13:31,360
It's all a matter of death.

293
00:13:31,759 --> 00:13:33,240
Why not take a big risk?

294
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,840
Besides,

295
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:37,240
there's still a chance to survive.

296
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:49,440
My people have arrived in Yunjing.

297
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,000
I need to go out and meet them.

298
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:50,799
Brother,

299
00:14:51,039 --> 00:14:52,639
the light gathering tool,

300
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,720
the light column needs to be farther.

301
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:56,519
This time in the Palace,

302
00:14:56,799 --> 00:14:57,799
not like in Huayue Tower,

303
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,759
we may need several light columns.

304
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:01,279
No problem.

305
00:15:01,559 --> 00:15:02,200
Give me two days,

306
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,240
and I'll make it better.

307
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:08,159
I heard that Su's Escort Agency has grown,

308
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,799
and you are picky about accepting escorts.

309
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:12,519
The notice said that

310
00:15:12,799 --> 00:15:15,240
the team of the Princess will arrive in three days.

311
00:15:15,279 --> 00:15:16,600
The team will indeed arrive in three days,

312
00:15:16,759 --> 00:15:17,840
but I missed you,

313
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:18,879
so I came early.

314
00:15:24,759 --> 00:15:26,440
It's true that you missed us,

315
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,159
but it's not just that, is it?

316
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:29,440
How's that?

317
00:15:29,519 --> 00:15:31,039
I told you she would ask directly.

318
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,679
I know her best.

319
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:34,519
Your Highness, you might as well say it.

320
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:37,600
The silver sent by Fuyun Escort Agency

321
00:15:37,759 --> 00:15:38,960
was caught by us.

322
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:41,480
During the confiscation, several account books were found.

323
00:15:41,639 --> 00:15:42,799
It involves the Langyue family,

324
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,159
which is in charge of the casting of silver coins.

325
00:15:45,519 --> 00:15:45,960
By the way,

326
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,039
I saw Yunjing was looking for Yikeba.

327
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:48,919
What's going on?

328
00:15:49,799 --> 00:15:51,759
The money sent by the Fuyun Escort Agency

329
00:15:51,919 --> 00:15:53,080
was for Yikeba.

330
00:15:53,519 --> 00:15:54,679
Unfortunately, he ran away.

331
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:56,840
Before we left Langyue,

332
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,320
Princess has sent a letter

333
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,639
to request joint arrest.

334
00:16:01,559 --> 00:16:02,639
I'm afraid the Yunjing government

335
00:16:02,639 --> 00:16:04,039
has been infiltrated by that force

336
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,320
and will protect Yikeba.

337
00:16:05,559 --> 00:16:06,080
So

338
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,039
I need you.

339
00:16:09,279 --> 00:16:10,279
If he's in Yunjing,

340
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,679
I'll mobilize the escorts

341
00:16:11,679 --> 00:16:12,799
to investigate.

342
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:13,440
Princess.

343
00:16:13,639 --> 00:16:14,279
Don't worry.

344
00:16:49,559 --> 00:16:51,879
Take these people inside.

345
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,200
You two split up and follow them.

346
00:16:59,320 --> 00:16:59,559
Okay.

347
00:17:15,359 --> 00:17:15,920
My lady,

348
00:17:16,319 --> 00:17:17,880
the master and the young master are here.

349
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:36,359
My lord, my lord.

350
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,039
Father, brother.

351
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:46,279
You should rest.

352
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:48,160
Leave us.

353
00:17:48,680 --> 00:17:49,319
Yes, sir.

354
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:02,680
You've been sick for days.

355
00:18:03,039 --> 00:18:04,240
Are you feeling better?

356
00:18:05,279 --> 00:18:06,160
I'm fine.

357
00:18:06,519 --> 00:18:08,000
Father, do you have any orders?

358
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:11,920
Yes, there is something

359
00:18:12,119 --> 00:18:13,319
I need you to do.

360
00:18:14,519 --> 00:18:15,440
Father, please.

361
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:16,920
I know

362
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:19,599
you have a grudge against the Sus.

363
00:18:21,279 --> 00:18:23,000
But the joint hosting of the poetry meeting

364
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,480
is the Emperor's decree.

365
00:18:24,759 --> 00:18:26,720
We can't keep dragging our feet.

366
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,000
It's the Ministry of Rites' responsibility.

367
00:18:28,799 --> 00:18:29,599
I think

368
00:18:29,839 --> 00:18:31,440
you just don't want to see Cheng Qi.

369
00:18:32,359 --> 00:18:34,559
You can't have him, so you're upset.

370
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,240
I never knew

371
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,039
you are such a person.

372
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,079
Father,

373
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:42,480
I know the speech contest is of great significance.

374
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:44,039
I'll go to the Ministry of Rites

375
00:18:44,039 --> 00:18:46,039
and Su's Escort Agency in the next few days.

376
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,599
I won't make any mistakes.

377
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,000
As for the speech contest,

378
00:18:49,559 --> 00:18:51,319
you can plan as usual.

379
00:18:52,039 --> 00:18:52,920
But there is one thing.

380
00:18:53,359 --> 00:18:56,319
You need to add a fireworks show to it.

381
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,519
For such a big occasion,

382
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:03,640
to add fireworks.

383
00:19:07,319 --> 00:19:08,880
It's gonna cost a lot.

384
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,839
Don't worry about the money.

385
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:12,039
The Ministry of Rites will cover it.

386
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:15,720
Later, Qijia will tell you how to do it.

387
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:18,160
Yes.

388
00:19:18,279 --> 00:19:20,480
I'll follow your arrangements.

389
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:22,839
Take care of yourself.

390
00:19:33,039 --> 00:19:33,680
My lady,

391
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,960
do you really have to go?

392
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,880
The knife is in my hand.

393
00:19:38,359 --> 00:19:39,319
I can't get rid of it.

394
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:41,119
If I don't stab him,

395
00:19:42,039 --> 00:19:43,200
I'll stab myself.

396
00:19:47,359 --> 00:19:49,079
Cheng Qi's words are really good.

397
00:19:50,039 --> 00:19:51,039
Take a look at the memorial

398
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:52,279
from the Ministry of Rites.

399
00:19:59,039 --> 00:19:59,920
Fireworks.

400
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:03,400
Your Majesty,

401
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,079
fireworks

402
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:07,319
have not been used for many years.

403
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:09,079
I'm not sure if it's safe

404
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,720
for such an important occasion.

405
00:20:11,079 --> 00:20:12,599
The fireworks for the Lantern Festival

406
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:14,039
in recent years have been good.

407
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:16,960
Fireworks are a specialty of our country.

408
00:20:17,519 --> 00:20:18,880
It's a good chance to show the elegance

409
00:20:19,319 --> 00:20:20,480
of our great country to the Langyue people.

410
00:20:22,279 --> 00:20:23,519
Your Majesty is wise.

411
00:20:28,279 --> 00:20:29,720
Setting off fireworks during the concert

412
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:31,000
is a mess.

413
00:20:31,559 --> 00:20:32,559
What if it catches fire

414
00:20:32,640 --> 00:20:34,079
and burns the props?

415
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:35,000
If it really catches fire,

416
00:20:35,039 --> 00:20:36,119
it's okay to burn the props,

417
00:20:36,119 --> 00:20:37,759
but if it burns the nobles,

418
00:20:37,759 --> 00:20:39,240
we will lose our heads.

419
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:40,799
Don't panic.

420
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:42,839
We can control the distance

421
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:44,799
and eliminate all hidden dangers.

422
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:47,279
It will be a highlight of the recitation meeting.

423
00:20:48,359 --> 00:20:49,720
The Princess likes fireworks.

424
00:20:50,039 --> 00:20:51,000
I think the Emperor

425
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:52,119
wants to make her happy.

426
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:54,079
I'll go to the Ministry of Rites earlier

427
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:55,279
to ask for the materials.

428
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:56,480
We must be perfect.

429
00:20:56,839 --> 00:20:57,279
Gong Xi.

430
00:20:57,559 --> 00:20:58,480
Tell the Princess

431
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:01,079
Yikeba should be in the Prime Minister's Mansion.

432
00:21:01,319 --> 00:21:02,319
We'll keep an eye on him.

433
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:03,680
Yes, My Lord.

434
00:21:11,599 --> 00:21:12,759
The Emperor has approved it.

435
00:21:13,240 --> 00:21:14,440
You are so insightful.

436
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:15,960
I know him

437
00:21:16,119 --> 00:21:17,319
better than anyone else.

438
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:18,920
He likes to make a quick success.

439
00:21:19,319 --> 00:21:20,519
He likes

440
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:21,920
such a grand scene the most.

441
00:21:23,799 --> 00:21:24,480
By the way, father,

442
00:21:25,119 --> 00:21:26,359
Mr. Ling sent a message that

443
00:21:26,759 --> 00:21:27,680
Su Yuejiao has been asking him

444
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,279
for the materials of fireworks these days.

445
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:30,359
So,

446
00:21:30,519 --> 00:21:31,400
should we give it to her or not?

447
00:21:31,839 --> 00:21:33,039
Of course, we should.

448
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:34,559
But,

449
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:37,079
you won't go.

450
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:43,000
My lady,

451
00:21:44,079 --> 00:21:45,240
are you really going alone?

452
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:46,960
What's up?

453
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:49,319
You really want to see her?

454
00:21:51,279 --> 00:21:52,680
What are you thinking about?

455
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,640
I'm worried about you.

456
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:58,720
She can't do anything to me in the daytime.

457
00:21:59,279 --> 00:22:00,039
I've been hiding for so long.

458
00:22:00,039 --> 00:22:01,039
I just want to see

459
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:03,960
what she wants to do.

460
00:22:09,519 --> 00:22:10,119
Enjoy yourself.

461
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:15,759
Don't worry.

462
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:18,319
That's grape juice.

463
00:22:21,839 --> 00:22:23,279
Why does the Ministry of Rites add fireworks

464
00:22:23,799 --> 00:22:24,880
to the recitation meeting?

465
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:28,440
Since you come straight to the point,

466
00:22:28,559 --> 00:22:29,680
I'll be frank.

467
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:31,480
I didn't want to be involved,

468
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:32,880
but I had no choice.

469
00:22:33,559 --> 00:22:35,279
Whether we like it or not,

470
00:22:35,599 --> 00:22:36,359
now

471
00:22:36,839 --> 00:22:38,519
we are in the same boat.

472
00:22:46,519 --> 00:22:48,359
These are the fireworks used before.

473
00:22:48,480 --> 00:22:50,759
They will be sent directly to the agency.

474
00:22:51,279 --> 00:22:52,319
As for how to use them,

475
00:22:52,519 --> 00:22:53,960
I don't need to teach you, do I?

476
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:00,359
Cheng Qi,

477
00:23:00,920 --> 00:23:01,839
I don't have much time.

478
00:23:02,279 --> 00:23:03,680
Let's make it short.

479
00:23:04,279 --> 00:23:05,680
Yikeba is going to kill the Emperor.

480
00:23:09,079 --> 00:23:10,359
Since you've got the news,

481
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:11,839
why not just arrest

482
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:14,039
the instigator behind it?

483
00:23:14,079 --> 00:23:14,680
I think

484
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:16,319
you can guess who it is.

485
00:23:18,519 --> 00:23:19,359
It's the Grand Preceptor.

486
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:22,880
For so many years,

487
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:23,960
he has been scheming

488
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:24,880
to cultivate his followers.

489
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:27,279
The court is complicated.

490
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,440
Yikeba

491
00:23:28,839 --> 00:23:31,200
must have been bewitched by the Grand Preceptor

492
00:23:31,759 --> 00:23:32,759
to fight to the death.

493
00:23:33,319 --> 00:23:34,160
His purpose

494
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:36,720
is to sabotage the relationship between our two countries,

495
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:38,160
so that he can

496
00:23:38,359 --> 00:23:39,880
profit from it.

497
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,559
The Emperor wants to catch the big snake,

498
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:44,920
and so do you.

499
00:23:47,279 --> 00:23:48,119
Then I'll quit.

500
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,279
I don't want my wife

501
00:23:50,279 --> 00:23:52,480
and the Escort Agency to get involved.

502
00:23:53,559 --> 00:23:54,240
Besides,

503
00:23:54,480 --> 00:23:55,480
we can't control

504
00:23:55,599 --> 00:23:56,839
the court affairs.

505
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:58,839
I disagree.

506
00:23:59,039 --> 00:24:01,599
The Emperor has read your works

507
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:02,880
and tested your depth

508
00:24:03,119 --> 00:24:04,559
when he summoned you.

509
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:07,119
You have a heart for the world

510
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:08,559
and a mind for the universe.

511
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,480
His Majesty

512
00:24:10,839 --> 00:24:12,039
considers you

513
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:14,119
as the pillar of our empire.

514
00:24:14,759 --> 00:24:17,079
This concerns the destiny of our two nations.

515
00:24:17,559 --> 00:24:18,119
You just need to

516
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:20,680
prepare for your performance.

517
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:22,119
Don't worry about anything else.

518
00:24:22,559 --> 00:24:25,279
We mustn't let the Grand Preceptor

519
00:24:25,279 --> 00:24:26,279
suspect anything.

520
00:24:28,599 --> 00:24:31,160
I'll find a way to remove the hidden dangers.

521
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:32,640
Your family's safety

522
00:24:32,799 --> 00:24:34,359
will also be protected.

523
00:24:43,359 --> 00:24:44,160
Actually,

524
00:24:45,839 --> 00:24:47,000
I envy you.

525
00:24:49,039 --> 00:24:50,079
You have family,

526
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:51,640
friends,

527
00:24:52,279 --> 00:24:53,160
and a husband.

528
00:24:54,839 --> 00:24:56,839
We are both women who stand on our own.

529
00:24:58,359 --> 00:24:59,200
But in the end,

530
00:25:00,559 --> 00:25:02,039
I only have myself.

531
00:25:02,759 --> 00:25:04,400
I have no one behind me.

532
00:25:05,799 --> 00:25:07,000
Am I familiar to you?

533
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,599
Why tell me this?

534
00:25:10,279 --> 00:25:12,079
Musicians and dancers of Huayue Tower,

535
00:25:12,559 --> 00:25:13,880
storehouses of Zhang's shops,

536
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:14,799
all are mine.

537
00:25:15,079 --> 00:25:16,279
You can use them freely.

538
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:18,599
Believe it or not,

539
00:25:19,279 --> 00:25:21,759
I have no interest in Cheng Qi anymore.

540
00:25:27,079 --> 00:25:28,480
The fireworks for the speech meeting

541
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:30,559
are a larger version of this.

542
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:32,680
One is fireworks,

543
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:33,920
and the other is explosives.

544
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:37,680
You need to distinguish them carefully.

545
00:25:38,079 --> 00:25:38,480
You...

546
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:40,519
What do you mean?

547
00:25:40,720 --> 00:25:41,240
Remember,

548
00:25:41,759 --> 00:25:43,640
the difference between fireworks and explosives

549
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:45,680
lies in the ratio of the fuse and powder.

550
00:25:45,839 --> 00:25:46,759
They look the same.

551
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:48,359
Wait.

552
00:25:49,039 --> 00:25:50,200
I'm a bit confused.

553
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,519
Are you trying to help me

554
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,000
or are you trying to harm me?

555
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:58,480
If something goes wrong at the recitation meeting,

556
00:25:59,839 --> 00:26:01,160
I'll also be held accountable.

557
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:05,440
You are the daughter of the Grand Preceptor,

558
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:06,680
while I'm just a humble escort.

559
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:09,319
If there's blame to be had, it falls on me.

560
00:26:10,119 --> 00:26:11,440
My father and brother

561
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:14,319
don't cherish me like your family and friends do.

562
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,519
I gave you the explosives,

563
00:26:17,519 --> 00:26:18,680
and you're the one who brought them in.

564
00:26:18,920 --> 00:26:19,759
If something goes wrong,

565
00:26:20,160 --> 00:26:22,000
we're both implicated.

566
00:26:25,359 --> 00:26:26,160
So,

567
00:26:26,599 --> 00:26:27,319
helping you

568
00:26:27,519 --> 00:26:28,960
is helping myself.

569
00:26:29,559 --> 00:26:30,400
Got it?

570
00:26:41,279 --> 00:26:43,039
Instead of wondering why I did this,

571
00:26:43,440 --> 00:26:45,359
you'd better think of a solution.

572
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:09,319
Zhang Xi Yun gave them to you?

573
