601
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:01,680
Big fish?

602
00:28:02,839 --> 00:28:03,400
The Grand Preceptor?

603
00:28:05,960 --> 00:28:08,440
Zhang Xi Yun probably didn't want to be used by her father,

604
